5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's like for other people! I'll check the supervised mornings on the next lane and the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think we should be careful about the money. I'll look into the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's see what the official gripes are. I'll check the ward complaint log for this point and the statements at the residents' meeting.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm worried about the workload. I'll look into the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Fairness is key here. I will check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
