25,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house at the station block smells really bad in summer! And the supervised mornings take almost an hour.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Midori,,"A shelter is quite expensive, even with the subsidy. Also, we're already spending over thirty thousand yen a year on maintenance.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Most complaints come from the person living right next to the bins. Plus, people aren't actually willing to police their neighbors.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,May,,"The truck comes very early, which makes a narrow window difficult. Those supervised shifts are about fifty minutes each.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Not all our frontages are the same size; some are too narrow. Also, the paperwork for a permanent build is very tedious.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Rin,,I don't want a smelly house!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Midori,,The costs are a real concern for some of us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,It seems we need a solution that doesn't rely on people being mean to each other.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,May,,"If we have to wake up at seven to stand there, I'm not happy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Asuka,,And moving the location requires a new notice every single time.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
