50,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option A sounds boring, B sounds like a game, and C smells! I like B!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Midori,,Option C is too expensive and the maintenance is high. I think B is the most balanced.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A requires policing neighbors, which fails. C creates new arguments. B is the most diplomatic.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,May,,A is too much work in the morning. C is a hassle to build. I'll go with B.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Asuka,,A is unfair to the supervisor. C is a bureaucratic nightmare. B distributes the burden equally.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Yay, B!","{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Midori,,It seems we all agree.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,Rare consensus.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,May,,Let's just do it.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Asuka,,It is the most logical choice.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
